  "description": "Unified, extensible database provider framework for relational databases. \n      Current implementation supports PostgreSQL with planned extensions for SQL Server, MySQL, Oracle, and Snowflake.\n      Features include query execution, stored procedure support (single/multiple cursors), \n      retry policies, comprehensive error handling, and integrated logging.",
  "id": "ND.FW.RDBM",
  "isPrerelease": false,
